WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.300
With the prints came Chinese porcelain, blue and white.

00:03.650 --> 00:07.089
This vase was painted in cobalt blue three centuries ago.

00:07.439 --> 00:14.918
Turn it with a fingertip, and touch the points to read its decoration: a court lady, a dancer, musicians.
